      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nWhen `VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1`, vLLM selects AITER's top-k/top-p sampler. On gfx942 (MI300X) that path segfaults in `aiter.top_k_top_p_sampling_from_probs` after warmup. `--enforce-eager` does not avoid it.\r\n\r\ngfx1250 already falls back to the native sampler via `_skip_aiter_sampler_on_gfx1250()`. This PR extends that guard to gfx942 so AITER can stay enabled for other kernels while sampling uses the PyTorch-native path.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n- [x] Serve `Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8` with TP=8 on 8x MI300X (`gfx942`) and `VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1`\r\n- [x] Confirm generation no longer crashes in `top_k_top_p_sampling_from_probs`\r\n- [x] Confirm other AITER ops remain available (only the sampler is skipped)\r\n\r\nServe command used:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nVLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1 VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_MOE=0 SAFETENSORS_FAST_GPU=1 \\\r\nvllm serve /models/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8 \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --trust-remote-code \\\r\n  --tensor-parallel-size 8 --enable-expert-parallel \\\r\n  --max-model-len auto --gpu-memory-utilization 0.9 \\\r\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching --max-num-seqs 256\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n- GSM8K Test Result\r\n|  Tasks  |Version|     Filter     |n-shot|  Metric   |   |Value |   |Stderr|\r\n|---------|------:|----------------|-----:|-----------|---|-----:|---|-----:|\r\n|gsm8k_cot|      3|flexible-extract|     5|exact_match|↑  |0.9629|±  |0.0052|\r\n|         |       |strict-match    |     5|exact_match|↑  |0.9575|±  |0.0056|\r\n\r\n- Before: worker crash in `torch.ops.aiter.top_k_top_p_sampling_from_probs` on gfx942\r\n- After: native sampler is used on gfx942; serving and sampling complete without that segfault\r\n\r\n",
